  "description": {
    "en": "The Tecnifibre T-FIGHT 300 IG is a modern performance racquet featuring a 100 sq.in head, 300 g unstrung weight, 320 mm balance and a 16x19 string pattern. Designed around the demands of today's faster game, it combines easy acceleration, excellent spin potential and balanced power with the RS Section frame and Isoflex technologies.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre T-FIGHT 300 IG 是一款现代竞技型球拍，采用100平方英寸拍面、300克空拍重量、320毫米平衡点及16×19线床。为了适应现代网球越来越快的节奏，Tecnifibre 重新优化了重量分布，降低挥拍惯性，使拍头加速更加轻松。RS Section 拍框结构兼顾力量与控制，而 Isoflex 技术进一步优化甜区与击球稳定性，使其成为一支兼具力量、旋转、操控与挥拍速度的现代化球拍。"
  },

